SUMMARY:Green Grass — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Green Grass\nRuntime: 17 min\nDirector: Aram Atkinson\nG
 enre: Drama\n\nIt's no secret that Declan is the university class coaster\,
  which is why his friends refuse to partner with him on their next assignme
 nt. Out of options\, Declan is forced to pair up with Claire\, the new Deaf
  student who is everything Declan isn't\; academic\, driven and fiercely pr
 oud of her identity. Set against the backdrop of coastal university life on
  the south coast of England\, Green Grass dips into the murky waters of str
 ained friendships\, sustainability\, and D/deaf identity in this coming-of-
 age drama.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1783196
END:VEVENT
