SUMMARY:Silt — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Silt\nRuntime: Unknown\nDirector: Aaron Jay Rome\nGenre:
  Horror\, Science Fiction\n\nHadria\, haunted by guilt she cannot explain\,
  is talked into a weekend at an exclusive lakeside sanctuary by her best fr
 iend Sierra\, and Sierra’s boyfriend Scott. She has never warmed to the hos
 ts\, Rick and Anna\, but she goes for a shot at something with Mike Warner\
 , a pro athlete sidelined by a knee injury. The property sits behind three 
 locked gates\, where hundreds of deer assemble\, watching. The lake comes w
 ith lore\, the kind that makes a good firepit story\, and Bartleby\, the ec
 centric owner\, tells them it carries the genes of the Gods. Hadria doesn’t
  buy any of it\, right up until the water starts proving Bartleby right.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1784178
