SUMMARY:Clarissa — In Theatres
STATUS:CANCELLED
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Clarissa\nRuntime: 135 min\nDirector: Chuko Esiri\, Arie
  Esiri\nGenre: Drama\n\nAcross a single day in Lagos\, Nigeria\, Clarissa p
 repares to host a high society party at her home\, as her complicated past 
 begins to consume her\, in the form of now-distant friends and loves from h
 er youth. Simultaneously\, Septimus\, a young soldier\, is haunted by his o
 wn memories of the horrors he has witnessed and endured. As the perspective
 s traverse past and present\, across the bourgeois class and those too easi
 ly forgotten by society\, a delicate portrait of contemporary Nigeria emerg
